WEBVTT

00:01.860 --> 00:06.660
Mr. Dumas isn't here anymore,
but Zed and I are. Right, Mickey?

00:07.700 --> 00:09.500
You have us.

00:13.480 --> 00:15.380
Why?

00:15.380 --> 00:16.980
If I'd ...

00:16.980 --> 00:19.280
If I'd been stronger...

00:19.880 --> 00:23.010
Teacher might not have had to die!

00:24.190 --> 00:25.810
Stronger!

00:31.660 --> 00:33.030
Slugna...

00:33.030 --> 00:34.500
Why is he here?

00:34.830 --> 00:42.570
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:42.570 --> 00:49.530
Towards a far, faraway place

01:02.890 --> 01:09.100
Blown by the wind, we walk on

01:09.100 --> 01:16.060
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:16.270 --> 01:22.580
Even if a time of loss should come

01:22.580 --> 01:29.710
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:32.150 --> 01:39.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:39.560 --> 01:45.530
Towards something we can't lose

01:45.530 --> 01:53.170
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:53.170 --> 02:00.050
Towards a far, faraway place

02:07.860 --> 02:11.950
Episode 15
A Small Treasure

02:42.660 --> 02:44.280
Mickey!

02:50.800 --> 02:52.430
Mickey!

02:54.240 --> 02:55.860
Mickey!

03:08.220 --> 03:10.840
What in the world happened to Mickey?

03:11.620 --> 03:15.920
That spirit was Mr. Dumas's Slugna, wasn't it?

03:15.920 --> 03:17.550
Yeah...

03:18.190 --> 03:20.430
Why would Mickey act like that?

03:20.430 --> 03:23.400
It's like Dumas has possessed him.

03:32.070 --> 03:34.640
That's impossible.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.610
B..But...

03:41.880 --> 03:45.150
I can't believe what I'm doing.

03:45.150 --> 03:48.090
I feel like I'm changing...

03:48.090 --> 03:50.220
I'm scared, Teacher.

03:59.700 --> 04:03.100
Then what was that?

04:03.100 --> 04:06.370
Why does Mickey have Slugna?

04:06.370 --> 04:08.670
Mr. Dumas is dead...

04:09.310 --> 04:12.310
What happens to a spirit when its master dies?

04:12.310 --> 04:16.440
It returns to nature, unless
someone collects it first.

04:18.990 --> 04:20.780
Him, huh?

04:24.160 --> 04:26.230
Dumas's spirit shard?

04:26.230 --> 04:27.360
Yeah...

04:27.360 --> 04:29.660
Oh, I took that and brought it back with me.

04:29.660 --> 04:31.170
So, it was you.

04:31.170 --> 04:34.000
Did you give that shard to Mickey?

04:34.000 --> 04:35.470
Mickey?

04:35.470 --> 04:36.900
Dumas's pupil.

04:36.900 --> 04:41.610
Oh, him. Yes, I did give it to him, as a memento.

04:41.610 --> 04:43.410
Is there a problem?

04:47.920 --> 04:49.710
Why, you!

04:53.050 --> 04:54.460
Give it back!

04:54.460 --> 04:56.460
Give me back my spirit!

04:56.460 --> 04:58.530
Let go! Let go!

04:58.530 --> 05:00.320
Let go of me!

05:01.300 --> 05:02.920
Ouch...

05:04.330 --> 05:06.400
Wh..What?

05:06.400 --> 05:08.530
D..Did I...

05:13.170 --> 05:15.180
I see...

05:15.180 --> 05:17.350
That wasn't his normal expression.

05:17.350 --> 05:20.140
It was as if Mr. Dumas had possessed him.

05:21.580 --> 05:24.320
" Possessed, " eh? You say some amusing things.

05:24.320 --> 05:26.550
But I'm afraid you're incorrect.

05:26.550 --> 05:28.990
Then, why is Mickey...

05:28.990 --> 05:33.490
Most likely he's just acting as he pleases.

05:33.490 --> 05:36.260
Being true to his own desires.

05:36.260 --> 05:37.600
That couldn't be...

05:37.600 --> 05:39.400
Yeah, right!

05:40.840 --> 05:44.790
You two don't know enough about the spirits.

05:50.710 --> 05:53.050
I wonder where I should go from here?

05:53.050 --> 05:55.020
What should I do?

05:58.890 --> 06:00.290
You're still awake?

06:00.290 --> 06:02.060
I can't sleep.

06:02.060 --> 06:04.290
I'm just too excited somehow.

06:04.290 --> 06:05.860
I wonder why?

06:05.860 --> 06:07.460
Hmm, I wonder?

06:07.460 --> 06:09.830
Maybe because tomorrow is your birthday?

06:09.830 --> 06:12.460
Oh, right! Maybe that's it!

06:14.540 --> 06:17.330
Here, happy birthday.

06:20.140 --> 06:22.940
So, you remembered, huh?

06:25.850 --> 06:27.680
What is it?

06:27.680 --> 06:32.650
Oh, I just remembered a time I gave
a birthday present to a friend.

06:32.650 --> 06:35.450
Friend? You mean a girl?

06:36.220 --> 06:37.460
No, no.

06:37.460 --> 06:40.260
A childhood friend named " Zed. "

06:40.260 --> 06:42.730
He's a very dear friend of mine.

06:43.830 --> 06:45.300
He's so lucky.

06:45.300 --> 06:47.930
I want a present too!

06:48.770 --> 06:51.440
I'm not sure I can give you exactly
what you want, but I'll try.

06:51.440 --> 06:53.710
What would you like for your birthday, Sagiri?

06:53.710 --> 06:54.810
You mean it?!

06:54.810 --> 06:56.740
Yep!

06:56.740 --> 06:58.370
Well...

06:59.410 --> 07:01.220
I want you to promise me.

07:01.220 --> 07:02.450
Promise you?

07:02.450 --> 07:03.450
Yeah!

07:03.450 --> 07:07.690
Promise me that you'll stay with us forever.

07:07.690 --> 07:10.430
That you'll always keep journeying with us.

07:10.430 --> 07:12.390
Th..That's ...

07:13.230 --> 07:15.460
So, she doesn't know yet.

07:15.460 --> 07:17.770
Noah, I don't want you to go.

07:17.770 --> 07:19.870
Don't go anywhere, okay?

07:19.870 --> 07:23.330
Promise me that you won't !

07:23.910 --> 07:25.530
Okay?

07:28.740 --> 07:30.370
Sure...

07:31.150 --> 07:35.020
" You two don't know enough
about the spirits, " eh?

07:35.020 --> 07:38.020
For Robès, that's an unusually
useful thing to say.

07:38.020 --> 07:39.990
What do you mean?

07:41.220 --> 07:46.960
Mickey's mind has been consumed by the spirit.

07:46.960 --> 07:48.760
His mind has been consumed?!

07:48.760 --> 07:52.730
The spirit has invaded his psyche.

07:52.730 --> 07:55.200
Just because someone is a shard caster,

07:55.200 --> 07:59.270
that doesn't necessarily mean
he can command a spirit,

07:59.270 --> 08:03.140
especially if the spirit is a strong one.

08:03.140 --> 08:06.940
You need a stronger psyche.

08:08.080 --> 08:13.210
You see, Zed, spirits sometimes destroy people.

08:14.620 --> 08:17.960
If someone without the power for it uses a spirit,

08:17.960 --> 08:22.730
that person will eventually cease to be human.

08:22.730 --> 08:26.570
He will lose human feeling.

08:26.570 --> 08:28.360
Hey, Zico!

08:28.800 --> 08:30.770
We have a serious problem.

08:32.340 --> 08:35.840
Two men have already been attacked,
and their spirits stolen.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.780
We must find him as soon as possible.

08:37.780 --> 08:39.410
Yes, sir!

08:40.110 --> 08:41.820
We've got to find him first!

08:41.820 --> 08:43.610
I know.

08:46.490 --> 08:48.460
This can't be...

08:49.490 --> 08:51.630
My body moves without my permission.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.920
I start wanting to fight so much.

08:56.030 --> 08:57.330
I'm scared.

08:57.330 --> 08:59.960
I'm turning into something that's not me!

09:01.900 --> 09:03.530
But...

09:05.040 --> 09:07.740
If I keep this, I can become strong.

09:07.740 --> 09:10.040
I can become like Teacher.

09:10.950 --> 09:12.740
But that's...

09:15.320 --> 09:17.440
No! It's no good!

09:37.870 --> 09:41.840
This is the joyous day when Sagiri
came into this world!

09:41.840 --> 09:43.810
Let's really celebrate!

09:43.810 --> 09:47.480
Hey, now, this drink is for adults.

09:47.480 --> 09:50.250
It's okay, because I'm one
year more adult today!

09:50.250 --> 09:53.490
Only childish people make arguments like that.

09:53.490 --> 09:56.660
Aw, why can't I have just a little?!

09:56.660 --> 09:58.280
No way.

10:00.700 --> 10:02.130
What is this?

10:02.130 --> 10:05.590
Today, I can hear that sound in my
head even louder than ever.

10:06.300 --> 10:09.540
It's like it's calling me...

10:09.540 --> 10:11.840
Noah! Noah!

10:12.810 --> 10:15.340
This is yummy. Want some?

10:15.340 --> 10:17.080
Thanks.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.450
Like it?

10:18.450 --> 10:19.550
It's good!

10:19.550 --> 10:21.170
See?

10:31.690 --> 10:33.790
Found you at last.

10:33.790 --> 10:36.420
What are you doing in a back alley like this?
Selling bread?

10:38.970 --> 10:42.600
You seem quite different from
the last time I saw you.

10:52.780 --> 10:55.620
You're just like Dumas was then.

10:55.620 --> 10:57.580
Your greed is bared for the world to see!

11:02.060 --> 11:03.890
Now, then...

11:03.890 --> 11:06.520
Why don't I bring you back to your senses?

11:08.760 --> 11:10.630
Stop it, Robès!

11:10.630 --> 11:12.430
Stop it, Mickey!

11:13.700 --> 11:15.500
Mickey, stop this!

11:37.360 --> 11:38.990
Mickey...

11:58.050 --> 12:00.180
So, this is where you've been.

12:00.180 --> 12:04.290
It's rare for you to come here.

12:04.290 --> 12:06.620
Did you remember the past?

12:06.620 --> 12:09.020
I've never forgotten it.

12:09.020 --> 12:10.960
I could never forget my foolishness,

12:10.960 --> 12:17.260
sacrificing so many lives in my
blind search for power.

12:18.600 --> 12:21.900
Zico, could Zed be...

12:23.270 --> 12:25.070
Am I right?!

12:28.210 --> 12:30.340
How should I know?

12:37.350 --> 12:39.190
Thank you for all your kindness.

12:39.190 --> 12:42.020
You don't mean to leave now, do you?

12:42.020 --> 12:44.230
I think that would be best.

12:44.230 --> 12:45.560
I see...

12:45.560 --> 12:47.530
I'm sorry for doing this to you.

12:49.700 --> 12:52.000
Wow, how do I look?

12:52.670 --> 12:56.300
Sagiri, I'm sorry I couldn't keep my promise.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.660
Oof...

13:00.780 --> 13:02.400
Okay...

13:08.120 --> 13:09.880
Grandpa, where's Noah?

13:09.880 --> 13:12.250
Hmm, I wonder where he went?

13:12.250 --> 13:14.720
Maybe he's gone over by the river?

13:15.320 --> 13:17.290
I'll go look for him!

13:18.430 --> 13:20.890
I'm sorry, Sagiri.

13:24.100 --> 13:28.140
If we don't find him fast, he'll crack for good.

13:28.140 --> 13:29.200
Yeah...

13:29.200 --> 13:31.170
But where could he be?

13:33.210 --> 13:35.140
I'm going to become strong.

13:35.140 --> 13:37.850
Stronger... Stronger...

13:37.850 --> 13:40.310
Strong like Teacher!

13:41.650 --> 13:44.450
If I take him down, I can become stronger!

13:45.090 --> 13:47.150
Sitting and thinking about it won't do any good.

13:47.150 --> 13:50.280
You won't find him if you're just
looking at random!

13:53.030 --> 13:55.130
What is it, Zed?

13:55.130 --> 13:57.100
He's saved me the trouble of looking.

14:00.300 --> 14:01.930
Mickey!

14:10.710 --> 14:12.340
Noah!

14:18.150 --> 14:20.280
